        <!-- Hero Image Placeholder -->
        <div class="h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] w-full bg-[#1a1a24] relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center border-b border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #2dd4bf 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight z-10 text-center px-4">70+ Free Online Tools in One Place: Discover SolversPro's Comprehensive Toolkit</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 md:p-12">
          <!-- Meta data -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-white/[0.06] font-mono">
            <span>Published: March 20, 2024</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>4 min read</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span class="text-[#2dd4bf] bg-[#2dd4bf]/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-[#2dd4bf]/20">Product Update</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Content -->
          <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-white prose-a:text-[#ff6b35] hover:prose-a:text-[#ff8c5a] prose-strong:text-zinc-200">
            <p class="lead text-xl text-zinc-300">
              In a digital landscape cluttered with single-purpose websites, ad-heavy interfaces, and tools locked behind paywalls, finding reliable utilities shouldn't feel like a treasure hunt. SolversPro's Online Tools collection changes that equation, offering over 70 free, browser-based tools organised into logical categories, all accessible without signups or subscriptions.
            </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">What Is SolversPro?</h2>
        <p>
          Located at <a href="/tools">solverspro.com/tools</a> and our various category pages, this resource hub brings together utilities that developers, designers, marketers, engineers, students, and everyday users need regularly. Rather than bookmarking dozens of separate websites, you get a single destination covering everything from PDF manipulation to financial calculators, password generation to IP lookups.
        </p>
        <p>
          The collection spans ten major categories, each packed with practical tools that do exactly what they promise—quickly, securely, and entirely in your browser.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Developer Tools: Code and Debug</h2>
        <p>Developers will find daily-use utilities in this category, built to handle common formatting and conversion tasks.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/json-tools">JSON Formatter</a> & <a href="/developer/xml-tools">XML Tools</a>:</strong> Check syntax and format data for readability.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/hash-generator">Hash Generator</a>:</strong> Generate MD5, SHA-1, SHA-256, and more hashes instantly.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/regex-tester">Regex Tester</a>:</strong> Test and debug regular expressions in real-time.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/base64-converter">Base64 Converter</a>:</strong> Encode and decode Base64 strings.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/jwt-decoder">JWT Decoder</a>:</strong> Decode JSON Web Tokens to inspect their payload.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/color-converter">Color Converter</a>:</strong> Translate colors between HEX, RGB, HSL, and CMYK.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/number-base">Number Base Converter</a>:</strong> Convert between binary, octal, decimal, and hexadecimal.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/developer/timestamp-converter">Timestamp Converter</a>:</strong> Convert Unix timestamps to human-readable dates and vice versa.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">PDF Tools: Manipulate and Convert</h2>
        <p>Working with PDFs is unavoidable, and these tools make common operations effortless—all processed locally on your device for maximum privacy.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li><strong><a href="/tools/pdf-merger">Merge</a> & <a href="/tools/pdf-split-pages">Split PDFs</a>:</strong> Combine multiple documents or extract specific pages.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/tools/pdf-protect">Protect</a> & <a href="/tools/pdf-remove-password">Remove Password</a>:</strong> Secure your documents or remove restrictions from files you own.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/tools/pdf-flatten">Flatten</a> & <a href="/tools/pdf-preflight">Preflight</a>:</strong> Prepare documents for printing and analyze their contents.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/tools/pdf-compose">Compose</a>:</strong> Build new PDFs from scratch.</li>
          <li><strong>Conversions:</strong> Seamlessly convert <a href="/tools/images-to-pdf">Images to PDF</a>, or extract content with <a href="/tools/pdf-to-images">PDF to Images</a>, <a href="/tools/pdf-to-text">PDF to Text</a>, and <a href="/tools/pdf-to-html">PDF to HTML</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Finance & Math: Calculate with Confidence</h2>
        <p>Whether you're planning investments or solving complex equations, our calculators provide professional-grade accuracy.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li><strong>Finance:</strong> <a href="/finance/compound-interest">Compound Interest</a>, <a href="/finance/simple-interest">Simple Interest</a>, <a href="/finance/roi-calculator">ROI</a>, <a href="/finance/mortgage-calculator">Mortgage</a>, and <a href="/finance/cash-on-cash-return">Cash-on-Cash Return</a> calculators.</li>
          <li><strong>Math:</strong> A full-featured <a href="/math/scientific-calculator">Scientific Calculator</a>, <a href="/math/quadratic-solver">Quadratic Solver</a>, <a href="/math/statistics-calculator">Statistics</a>, <a href="/math/geometry-calculator">Geometry</a>, <a href="/math/matrix-calculator">Matrix operations</a>, and <a href="/math/percentage-calculator">Percentage</a> calculators.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/math/unit-converter">Unit Converter</a>:</strong> Instantly convert between hundreds of units across length, mass, temperature, and more.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Network & Security: Verify and Protect</h2>
        <p>Essential utilities for sysadmins and security-conscious users.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li><strong><a href="/network/ip-subnet-calculator">IP Subnet Calculator</a>:</strong> Calculate network address, broadcast, and host ranges using CIDR notation.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/network/my-ip">My IP Checker</a> & <a href="/network/ip-lookup">IP Address Lookup</a>:</strong> Find your public IP or look up geolocation, ISP, and ASN data for any address.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/security/password-generator">Password Generator</a>:</strong> Create secure, complex passwords with customizable requirements.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Text & Utilities: Generate and Transform</h2>
        <p>Handy tools for daily tasks and specialized projects.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li><strong>Text Tools:</strong> <a href="/text/word-counter">Word Counter</a>, <a href="/text/case-converter">Case Converter</a>, <a href="/text/lorem-ipsum">Lorem Ipsum Generator</a>, <a href="/text/url-encoder">URL Encoder</a>, and even a <a href="/text/morse-code">Morse Code Translator</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Trades & Engineering:</strong> Specialized calculators for <a href="/trades/concrete-slab">Concrete Slabs</a>, <a href="/trades/wire-size">Wire Sizing</a>, <a href="/trades/board-feet">Board Feet</a>, <a href="/trades/paint-calculator">Paint</a>, and <a href="/trades/solar-panel">Solar Panels</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Health:</strong> <a href="/health/bmi-calculator">BMI</a> and <a href="/health/tdee-calculator">TDEE</a> calculators for tracking fitness goals.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/qr/qr-generator">QR Code Generator</a>:</strong> Create scannable codes for URLs, text, Wi-Fi, and more.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Why Choose SolversPro Tools?</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mt-6">
          <li><strong>No account required.</strong> Every tool works immediately without registration, email verification, or profile creation.</li>
          <li><strong>Privacy first.</strong> The vast majority of our tools—including all PDF manipulation—run entirely client-side in your browser. Your sensitive files and data never leave your device.</li>
          <li><strong>No usage limits.</strong> Use the standard tools as often as needed without hitting caps or being asked to upgrade.</li>
          <li><strong>Clean interface.</strong> The focus stays on functionality rather than advertisements or upsells.</li>
          <li><strong>Dashboard integration.</strong> Save your results directly to your browser's local storage for easy reference later.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Final Thoughts</h2>
        <p>
          SolversPro's tools collection represents what online utilities should be: comprehensive, accessible, fast, and respectful of users' privacy. No hunting across multiple sites, no creating accounts for one-time tasks, no worrying about uploading sensitive documents to unknown servers.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you need to merge an invoice PDF, calculate compound interest, generate a secure password, or decode a JWT, the tool exists and works exactly as expected. That kind of reliability earns a permanent bookmark.
        </p>

